00:01:32.125 --> 00:01:33.350
(Santas laughing)

00:01:33.350 --> 00:01:35.517
- I like just ordinary
chocolate chip cookies.

00:01:35.517 --> 00:01:36.863
- I like snickerdoodles.

00:01:38.410 --> 00:01:40.170
