00:01:54.200 --> 00:01:55.640
I said, "Well, I wanna Santa size."

00:01:55.640 --> 00:01:57.931
So they got me this, okay?

00:01:57.931 --> 00:01:59.560
And this is in the pocket of my suit

00:01:59.560 --> 00:02:00.420
