00:05:03.907 --> 00:05:06.558
- Hi, Santa. Can I take a picture?

00:05:06.558 --> 00:05:07.678
- [Santa David] Sure!

00:05:07.678 --> 00:05:08.529
- [Santa Joseph] Yeah!

00:05:08.529 --> 00:05:11.520
(Santas laughing together)

00:05:11.520 --> 00:05:12.850
- [Santa Curtis] Merry Christmas!

00:05:12.850 --> 00:05:14.749
