00:05:35.200 --> 00:05:40.140
- But I heard all of the
reindeers who are female.

00:05:40.140 --> 00:05:40.973
- Oh.

00:05:40.973 --> 00:05:41.806
- [Santa Chuck] No.

00:05:41.806 --> 00:05:42.639
- [Santa Clifford] No.

00:05:42.639 --> 00:05:43.472
- Dasher is a boy.

00:05:43.472 --> 00:05:44.450
- Dasher is a boy.

00:05:44.450 --> 00:05:45.790
Dancer is a girl.

00:05:45.790 --> 00:05:46.740
- So is vixen

00:05:46.740 --> 00:05:47.753
- Vixen is a girl too.

00:05:47.753 --> 00:05:49.060
- What about Donner?

00:05:49.060 --> 00:05:51.393
- Donner is a boy.
- Boy.

00:05:51.393 --> 00:05:53.430
- Where's the North Pole?

00:05:53.430 --> 00:05:55.890
- Way up at the top of the world.

00:05:55.890 --> 00:05:57.079
- [Santa David] That way!

00:05:57.079 --> 00:05:57.912
- Oh.

00:05:58.880 --> 00:06:00.990
