00:06:42.333 --> 00:06:43.166
- [Santa David] Yes!

00:06:43.166 --> 00:06:44.024
Real Santa!

00:06:44.024 --> 00:06:47.895
- [Santa Chuck] Very good, very good!

00:06:47.895 --> 00:06:50.036
- I think he's the real Santa Claus.

00:06:50.036 --> 00:06:51.635
(Santa Clifford ho-ho-ho's)

00:06:51.635 --> 00:06:52.468
- [Santa David] Good job!

00:06:52.468 --> 00:06:53.301
- [Santa Curtis] You got it right!

00:06:53.301 --> 00:06:55.577
- [Santa David] Gettin' it
right! (Santas all cheering)

00:06:55.577 --> 00:06:59.416
- I think the one that's the real Santa

00:06:59.416 --> 00:07:00.249
