00:07:02.095 --> 00:07:02.928
you.

00:07:03.972 --> 00:07:04.997
- [Director] You got it!

00:07:04.997 --> 00:07:05.830
- I did?

00:07:05.830 --> 00:07:07.270
- [Santa David] Wonderful! Wonderful!

00:07:07.270 --> 00:07:08.357
Excellent! Yes.

00:07:08.357 --> 00:07:09.497
- Ho, ho, ho!

00:07:09.497 --> 00:07:10.330
- Hi!

00:07:12.077 --> 00:07:13.500
That's so cool.

00:07:13.500 --> 00:07:15.570
