00:07:31.300 --> 00:07:35.040
- I would like a, a Lego set.

00:07:35.040 --> 00:07:36.510
- Oh! Those are so much fun.

00:07:36.510 --> 00:07:39.467
- What do you want for
Christmas this year?

00:07:39.467 --> 00:07:40.567
- A toy?

00:07:40.567 --> 00:07:41.667
- Any old kind of toy?

00:07:42.800 --> 00:07:44.697
- I don't want a old one.

00:07:44.697 --> 00:07:46.598
(Santas all laughing)

00:07:46.598 --> 00:07:47.756
- The answer would be new toys.

00:07:47.756 --> 00:07:50.006
- I like that one.

00:07:50.006 --> 00:07:51.030
