00:08:00.400 --> 00:08:02.060
'cause they're the ones
that package everything

00:08:02.060 --> 00:08:03.690
up and put all the labels and all that

00:08:03.690 --> 00:08:04.830
on there, you know?

00:08:04.830 --> 00:08:07.960
So, I don't know what happened last year

00:08:07.960 --> 00:08:10.150
because with COVID and all that,

00:08:10.150 --> 00:08:13.370
it was such a wild and crazy year.

00:08:13.370 --> 00:08:15.657
So I'll talk to them when I get home.

00:08:15.657 --> 00:08:16.490
- Okay.

00:08:16.490 --> 00:08:17.330
- Okay?

00:08:17.330 --> 00:08:19.470
- [Little Girl] One other
thing, how old are you?

00:08:19.470 --> 00:08:20.699
- How old am I?

00:08:20.699 --> 00:08:21.770
- Yeah.

00:08:21.770 --> 00:08:24.500
- Well, I'm the same age as my tongue

00:08:24.500 --> 00:08:26.808
and older than my back teeth.

00:08:26.808 --> 00:08:27.641
- Huh?

00:08:27.641 --> 00:08:28.480
(Santas laughing)

00:08:28.480 --> 00:08:29.400
- I'm really old.

00:08:29.400 --> 00:08:30.550
You being good?

00:08:30.550 --> 00:08:31.383
- Yeah.

00:08:31.383 --> 00:08:32.830
- Helping out mom and dad and all that?

00:08:32.830 --> 00:08:33.890
Doing your chores?

00:08:33.890 --> 00:08:34.780
- Yes.

00:08:34.780 --> 00:08:35.695
- [Santa Clifford] Yeah.

00:08:35.695 --> 00:08:36.528
- [Santa Joseph] Good.

00:08:36.528 --> 00:08:37.361
- Any other questions?

00:08:38.825 --> 00:08:39.658
- Uh-uh.

00:08:39.658 --> 00:08:41.380
- Okay. You have a good day, okay?

00:08:41.380 --> 00:08:42.213
Buh-bye!

00:08:42.213 --> 00:08:43.730
- [Santa Joseph] Ho, ho, ho!

00:08:43.730 --> 00:08:45.690
- [Santa David] Merry Christmas!

00:08:45.690 --> 00:08:47.111
- Like. Comment.

00:08:47.111 --> 00:08:48.320
- And subscribe.
- Comment, like, subscribe.

00:08:48.320 --> 00:08:49.710
- And make sure to ring the bell

00:08:49.710 --> 00:08:51.150
so you get a notification whenever

00:08:51.150 --> 00:08:52.050
there's a new episode.

00:08:52.050 --> 00:08:53.600
- Ho, ho, ho, ho!

00:08:53.600 --> 00:08:56.519
- Merry Christmas!

